================================================================================
DISTRIBUTION SCOPE
================================================================================

The release artifact is the single-file VST3 plug-in (Windows; AU is optional
on macOS).  No VST2 or LV2 binaries are shipped.  The VST2 clean-room headers
are source-only and are covered by LICENSES/VST2-SDK-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
Build/dist-win is a development runtime (preview app and shared Qt DLLs) and
is not a release artifact; its Qt DLLs and QML modules are covered by the Qt
licences above.  A development VST3 zip is not part of the release.

If a shared-Qt development bundle is distributed, it must additionally carry
the notices for its Mesa/LLVM software OpenGL (opengl32sw.dll), Microsoft DXC
(dxcompiler.dll, dxil.dll), D3Dcompiler_47.dll and the MSVC runtime DLLs.
None of those are part of the single-file static VST3.

